  "rationale": "Blocking memoryDump:credentialAccess cuts off every AND step that needs it: ssoLogin:authenticate and dbLogin:authenticate both fail. That disables appServer:lateralMovement (via ssoLogin) and backupHost:lateralMovement (via dbLogin). As a result vaultRead, secretsManager and domainAdmin are also unreachable. Blocking jumpHost:lateralMovement additionally disables serviceAccount:privilegeEscalation. Checking each parent of the target: mailArchive needs secretsManager, jumpHost or serviceAccount, all unreachable. vaultRead needs backupHost, unreachable. dbReplica needs appServer or domainAdmin, both unreachable. codeRepo needs backupHost, secretsManager or jumpHost, all unreachable. So crownData:exfiltrate cannot be reached."
